{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flipping Phantom is a 2D pixel-art, jump-less platformer. Master the timing of your gravity-inversion and float abilities to navigate through a myriad of maze-like levels while avoiding contact with other-worldly obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866090/extras/d35faa56739e2f87a754b84677afea72.poster.avif?t=1759958877\" width=960 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866090/extras/d35faa56739e2f87a754b84677afea72.webm?t=1759958877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866090/extras/d35faa56739e2f87a754b84677afea72.mp4?t=1759958877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your way through distinct worlds that introduce new environmental mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect pumpkins to unlock additional levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866090/extras/109a67997390110e6378cc4910e13eec.poster.avif?t=1759958877\" width=960 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866090/extras/109a67997390110e6378cc4910e13eec.webm?t=1759958877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866090/extras/109a67997390110e6378cc4910e13eec.mp4?t=1759958877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve cryptic clues and uncover secrets to help reunite the ghost with all their spooky friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Credits</h2><p class=\"bb_pa